sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant A as App.tsx
  participant P as problem.ts
  participant E as engine.ts (runGA)
  participant G as GA operators
  participant C as Live chart
  participant T as Timetable.tsx

  U->>A: Edit data / parameters (optional)
  A->>P: buildProblem(data)
  alt data is invalid
    P-->>A: Error (e.g. "No teacher can teach X")
    A-->>U: Show message, disable Generate
  else data is valid
    P-->>A: Problem (48 sessions)
    U->>A: Click "Generate timetable"
    A->>E: runGA(problem, onProgress, config)
    E->>G: randomChromosome() × 100
    loop each generation, until a stopping rule holds
      E->>G: evaluate · tournament · crossover · mutate · repair
      G-->>E: next population
      E-->>A: onProgress(generation, best fitness, violations)
      A->>C: add point and redraw
    end
    E-->>A: Result (best chromosome, fitness, solvedAt, time)
    A->>T: render best chromosome
    T-->>U: Grid by batch / teacher / room
  end
